OrangutanAdventureSumatra redesign

Modern Next.js landing and booking website based on content from:
https://www.orangutanadventuresumatra.com/

Run locally:

1. npm run build
2. npm run start -- --hostname 127.0.0.1 --port 3000

Sharing and routes:

- Localized pages: /en, /de, /fr, /nl
- Essential information page: /essential-information
- Privacy policy page: /privacy
- Travel blog index and articles: /blog
- Sitemap: /sitemap.xml
- Robots: /robots.txt
- AI crawler summary: /llms.txt
- Link preview image: public/images/link-preview.jpg
- Regenerate link preview: npm run preview-image

Main files:

- app/page.tsx: homepage content, trek packages, FAQ, guide sections, booking CTAs.
- app/globals.css: responsive layout, animation, and visual design.
- app/seo.ts: canonical URLs, hreflang, Open Graph, Twitter card, and robots metadata helpers.
- app/[locale]/page.tsx: localized language routes.
- public/images/: local copies of key images from the existing website.
- scripts/fix-next-static-assets.mjs: post-build asset alias helper for the local Next build.
- scripts/generate-link-preview.mjs: creates the Open Graph/Twitter preview image.
